deedglass agent · Register and control agents

Usage  deedglass agent <command> [flags]

  create         Register an agent
  list           List agents
  show           Show one agent
  suspend        Suspend an agent
  resume         Resume a suspended agent
  stop           Stop an agent now
  start          Start a stopped agent
  keys create    Create an API key for an agent
  keys list      List an agent's API keys
  keys roll      Replace an API key, with an overlap
  keys revoke    Revoke an API key
  intent keygen  Generate a signed-intent key pair         soon · S09
  intent add     Register an intent public key             soon · S09
  intent list    List an agent's intent keys               soon · S09
  intent remove  Remove an intent key                      soon · S09
  intent mode    Require, allow or ignore signed intents   soon · S09

